[Music]  welcome everyone to streaming the galaxy  my name is rocky riley and today we're  going to be going over everything you  need to know before watching star wars  visions but before we get started if  you're new to the channel please hit the  subscribe button and click the bell icon  to be notified whenever we upload a new  video  now star wars visions is going to be a  series of animated short films  celebrating the star wars galaxy through  the lens of some of the world's best  anime studios with a total of nine  stories from different creators this  anthology collection should bring a new  diverse cultural perspective to the star  wars galaxy the show will air on  wednesday september 22nd on disney plus  and unlike many other new star wars and  marvel tv shows every episode will be  available on the release date so get  ready to binge  the episode lengths have not yet been  released but the titles have starting  off with the duel then lapinacho  tatooine rhapsody the twins the elder  the village bride akakiri tob1 and the  9th jedi  the creative studios for these episodes  are kamikaze duga gino studio sudo  colorito  trigger kinema citrus science saru and  production ig  each of the episodes will have their own  original score some of which will be  uniquely inspired by the john williams  classics ever since the release of the  mandalorian i've been hoping for more  new music from the star wars universe so  this is very exciting for me  for those of you who aren't familiar  with anime or any japanese inspired  stories you may be wondering if you'll  enjoy this show but don't worry even if  you aren't a fan of anime the art styles  of anime will go together with the star  wars storytelling like peanut butter and  chocolate according to james wah the  show's executive producer it sounds like  regardless of your familiarity with  anime the creators believe you'll easily  be able to identify with these new star  wars stories coming from someone with  limited experience in anime titles i'm  very excited to see what the show will  bring to the table  the biggest question most people seem to  have about this show though is is it  canon and the short answer is  no  but i do believe that these stories will  draw upon other ones we have already  come to know and love and i can see  future star wars projects perhaps  mentioning akakiri or some event which  occurs in star wars visions in an  offhand comment or easter egg this  show's main goal is to provide a  landscape for talented artists and story  writers to come together to produce  intriguing and exciting stories without  having to be tied to a canon storyline  or previous character interactions i  believe most if not all of the  characters we see will either be  completely new to the audience or take  an inspirational twist on ones we have  seen before  james hua again said we were looking for  something from the heart and soul of the  individual creators they are their  visions through the lens of star wars  lucasfilm also recently announced a new  book titled ronin a visions novel with  the release date of october 12th this  novel will expand upon the story in the  visions episode the duel following an  unnamed sith samurai wandering the  galaxy written by emma miko ken don this  story will likely end up being  referenced in future star wars titles  and that's everything we know so far and  everything you need to know before  watching star wars visions when it's  released later this month  if you enjoyed today's video please  consider dropping a like and if you have  ideas that you'd like to share for  future videos please drop them in the  comments section below  also don't forget to subscribe for more  great content  from everyone here at stream in the  galaxy we hope you have a great day and  thanks for watching  you

